---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'June 25, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — IBE"
  description="The terms that govern use of the Integrated Building Engineering website at ibe.engineering."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container policy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
      <h1>Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="policy__meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        These terms govern your use of the Integrated Building Engineering ("IBE") website at
        <a href="https://ibe.engineering">ibe.engineering</a>. IBE is a brand of T.R.W. Design,
        LLC. By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use
        the site.
      </p>

      <h2>This site does not create an engagement</h2>
      <p>
        The information on this site is for general information about IBE's services and tools.
        Using the site, emailing us, or requesting information does not by itself create a
        client engagement, a professional-services relationship, or any contract. Engineering
        engagements are governed solely by a written contract or proposal that IBE and the
        client sign directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site is not engineering, legal, or professional advice and should not be
        relied on as such. Engineering services are performed only under a signed agreement and,
        where required, by appropriately licensed professionals.
      </p>

      <h2>The IBE Toolbox is a separate product</h2>
      <p>
        The IBE Toolbox application at
        <a href="https://toolbox.ibe.engineering">toolbox.ibe.engineering</a> is a separate
        product with its own terms of use, which you accept when you create an account or use
        that application. Outputs generated by Toolbox tools are aids to a qualified
        professional's work — they do not replace professional review, code compliance checks,
        or stamped documents.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site, its content, logos, and the IBE and Integrat3D marks are owned by IBE or its
        licensors. You may view and share the content for your own informational use, but you
        may not copy, republish, or use it commercially without our written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        Don't use the site unlawfully, attempt to disrupt or gain unauthorized access to it, or
        misrepresent your affiliation with IBE.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The site may link to third-party sites we don't control. We're not responsible for
        their content or practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer and limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, to the fullest extent
        permitted by law. To the fullest extent permitted by law, IBE is not liable for any
        indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. Changes take effect when posted, and we'll
        revise the "last updated" date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of New Hampshire, United States,
        without regard to its conflict-of-laws rules. Any disputes will be handled in the state
        or federal courts located in New Hampshire.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Email
        <a href="mailto:info@ibe.engineering?subject=Terms%20question">info@ibe.engineering</a>
        or call <a href="tel:+16035212604">(603) 521-2604</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }
  .policy h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  }
  .policy__meta {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    margin-top: calc(-1 * var(--s-2));
  }
  .policy h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-top: var(--s-6);
  }
  .policy p,
  .policy li {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .policy a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
